---
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import Stats from "../components/Stats.svelte";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const BUTTONS = [
	{ src: "/88x31/riir.gif", href: "http://rust-lang.org/" },
	{ src: "/88x31/vexidenowanimated.gif", href: "https://vexide.dev/" },
	{
		src: "/88x31/OneShot_button.gif",
		href: "https://futurecatgames.itch.io/oneshot",
	},
	{
		src: "https://nekoweb.org/assets/buttons/button6.gif",
		href: "https://nekoweb.org/",
	},
	{ src: "/88x31/Rain_World_button.gif", href: "https://rainworldgame.com/" },
	{ src: "/88x31/webarchive.gif", href: "https://archive.org/" },
	{
		src: "/88x31/ublock-now.png",
		href: "https://github.com/gorhill/uBlock/",
	},
	{ src: "/88x31/ds91.png" },
	{
		src: "/88x31/transrights.png",
		href: "https://youareanangel.love/amianangel",
	},
	{
		src: "/88x31/9button.png",
		href: "https://9front.org/",
	},

	{ src: "/88x31/gbbutton.gif", href: "http://glassbeach.band/" },
	{ src: "/88x31/css.png", href: "https://wiki.csswg.org/ideas/mistakes/" },
	{ src: "/88x31/ieget-an.gif", href: "https://helium.computer/" },
	{ src: "/88x31/ralsei.gif", href: "https://deltarune.com/code/" },
	{ src: "/88x31/yumenikki.gif", href: "https://ynoproject.net/" },
	{
		src: "/88x31/uty.png",
		href: "https://gamejolt.com/games/UndertaleYellow/136925",
	},
	{ src: "/88x31/gimp.png", href: "https://www.gimp.org/" },
	{ src: "/88x31/krita.gif", href: "https://krita.org/" },
	{ src: "/88x31/ezgif.gif", href: "http://ezgif.com/" },
	{ src: "/88x31/powered-llvm.gif", href: "https://llvm.org/" },
	{ src: "/88x31/astro.png", href: "https://astro.build/" },
	{
		src: "/88x31/servo.jpeg",
		href: "https://servo.org/",
	},
	{
		src: "/88x31/sgi.jpg",
		href: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1sKHc7ubwA4",
	},
];
---

<script>
	// バンダ
	let titleCursor = false;
	setInterval(() => {
		titleCursor = !titleCursor;
		document.title = titleCursor
			? "tropical@island ~> _"
			: "tropical@island ~>";
	}, 500);
</script>

<Layout title="tropical@island ~>">
	<div id="content">
		<div class="left-column">
			<Section id="hi" tag="article" title="01. hello!!!!!">
				<h2>welcome to my page!</h2>

				<p>
					hello! I go by <u
						title="the name means nothing in particular, eight-year-old me just thought it sounded cool"
						>tropical</u
					> online, and I poke at computer<i>s</i> for fun. I'm a hobbyist
					pr<i>o</i>grammer (update: student) interested in embedded
					devices, hardware hacking, software reverse-engineering,
					competitive robotics, UI/UX design/accessibi<i>l</i>ity, and
					music.
				</p>

				<p>
					I <i>s</i>pend my free time playing indie games and rhy<i
						>t</i
					>hm games, practicing piano, and star<i>i</i>ng at <u
						class="lamplighter">street lamps</u
					> and telephone poles as all normal people do.
				</p>
				<strong
					style="display: block; margin: 8px 0; opacity: 0.5; font-style: italic; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 16px;"
				>
					anyways.....
					<br />
				</strong>

				<p>
					You might have met me in a few corners of the internet
					before. If any of this seems interesting, you can <i>c</i
					>heck out my <a href="/projects">projects</a> page for a list
					of things i've made or help<i>e</i>d out with. ok byeee! 🌴
					🦭
				</p>
			</Section>
			<Section
				id="nerds"
				tag="article"
				title="03. waow, everything's computer"
			>
				<h2>stuff for nerds :></h2>

				<p>
					Most of what work on is adjacent to systems programming,
					compilers, and firmware. I like learning how things work by
					ripping them apart at the low level. Usually I work in Rust,
					assembly, or C, but if you need a list:
				</p>

				<ul>
					<li>
						<u
							title="i maintain a tier-3 target in the rust compiler!"
							>Rust</u
						>
					</li>
					<li>
						<u title="its okay.">C</u>/<u
							title="this programming language makes me violent."
							>C++</u
						>
					</li>
					<li>ARM32, AArch64, and MIPS assembly language</li>
					<li>
						Typical web stuff: HTML, (S)<u
							title="my first language! (I taught this to myself before learning HTML, don't ask)"
							>CSS</u
						>, JS, TS, <u
							title="(p)react, svelte, solid, vue, astro"
							>all the frameworks</u
						>, etc...
					</li>
					<li>
						Python, <u
							title="the two valid uses of Java are minecraft mods and native android dev and absolutely nothing else."
							>Java</u
						>, some other boring ones not worthy of mention...
					</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>this site</h2>

				<p>
					I'm also into webdev and UI/UX design, though i've kept my
					distance from that space recently due of the sheer volume of
					slop that JavaScript devs put out these days. This site was
					built using <a
						href="https://astro.build/"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noreferrer noopener">Astro</a
					> and <a
						href="https://svelte.dev/"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noreferrer noopener">Svelte</a
					>!
				</p>

				<h2
					title="the next person to start a conversation with me about this will have cinderblocks lobbed through their window. thank you for your attention to this matter."
				>
					<u>on artificial intelligence</u>
				</h2>

				<p>
					<img
						style="float: right; margin-left: 12px;"
						width="48"
						height="64"
						alt="Lamplighter lighting a lamp"
						id="lamplighter"
						src="/blorbo/lamplighter.webp"
					/>
					I'm not against AI conceptually, but I have a strong distaste
					for both the <u title="nuke san francisco"
						>industry pushing it</u
					> and people who become <u
						title="please throw rocks at your local tpot techbro."
						>totally reliant on it</u
					>. everything is a little more <u
						title="read: effort and care. something lacking both is not worth engaging with"
						>devoid of soul</u
					> since LLMs and <u
						title="these are particularly fucking indefensible."
						>diffusion models</u
					> became mainstream, and that's sad to see :{"<"}
				</p>
			</Section>
		</div>
		<aside class="right-column">
			<Section decorative id="buttons">
				<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
					{
						Array.from({ length: 2 }, (_) => (
							<div class="marquee-items">
								{BUTTONS.map(({ src, href }) =>
									href ? (
										<a
											href={href}
											target="_blank"
											rel="noreferrer noopener"
											tabindex="-1"
										>
											<img
												loading="lazy"
												src={src}
												width="88"
												height="31"
											/>
										</a>
									) : (
										<img
											loading="lazy"
											src={src}
											width="88"
											height="31"
										/>
									),
								)}
							</div>
						))
					}
				</div>
			</Section>
			<Section decorative>
				<img
					class="pipes"
					alt="Pipes"
					src="/pipes.svg"
					width="298"
					height="187"
				/>
			</Section>
			<Section id="socials" tag="article" title="02. go stalk me">
				<ul>
					<li>
						<a
							href="https://github.com/tropicaaal/"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener">GitHub - tropicaaal</a
						>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a
							href="https://twitter.com/tropix126"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener">Twitter - @tropix126</a
						>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a
							href="https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:wabzp2nyfbapw743obf74mfv"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener">Bluesky - @tropical.sh</a
						>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a
							href="https://reddit.com/u/tropix126"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener">Reddit - u/tropix126</a
						>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a
							href="https://discord.com/users/254362351170617345"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener">Discord - @tropicaal</a
						>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a
							href="https://twitch.tv/tropix126"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener">Twitch - tropical126</a
						>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a
							href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYZDyX9Bk4CfroddX9-t9VA"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener">YouTube - @tropicaal</a
						>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</Section>
			<Section decorative id="music">
				<a
					class="sepia"
					href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qCAx4ynlIUM"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noreferrer noopener"
				>
					<img alt="sepia" src="/blorbo/sepia.gif" />
				</a>
				<div class="titlebar">
					♪ take care of yourself
					<div class="controls" aria-hidden="true">
						<button tabindex="-1" class="minimize"></button>
						<button tabindex="-1" class="maximize"></button>
						<button tabindex="-1" class="close"></button>
					</div>
				</div>
				<audio controls loop src="/audio/moon.m4a"></audio>
			</Section>
			<Section id="stats" title="04. nekoweb stats (requires JS)">
				<Stats site="tropical.nekoweb.org" client:load />
				<a
					href="https://nekoweb.org/follow/tropical.nekoweb.org"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noreferrer noopener"
					class="button">Follow me!!</a
				>
			</Section>
			<Section id="spinning-cat" decorative>
				<a
					href="https://cat.vexide.dev/"
					title="maxwell"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noreferrer noopener"
				>
					<img
						width="50"
						height="33.5"
						src="/blorbo/maxwell.gif"
						alt="cat spinning"
					/>
				</a>
				<span>spin</span>
			</Section>
		</aside>
	</div>

	<style>
		.left-column {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			flex: 1 1 auto;
			gap: 16px;
		}

		aside {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 16px;
			flex: 0 0 auto;
			width: 300px;
		}

		section:last-child {
			margin-bottom: 0;
		}

		section.decorative {
			padding: 0;
		}

		.pipes {
			display: block;
			width: 100%;
			height: auto;
			max-height: 250px;
			object-fit: cover;
		}

		#music {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			background: silver;
			border: none;
			box-shadow:
				inset -1px -1px #0a0a0a,
				inset 1px 1px #dfdfdf,
				inset -2px -2px grey,
				inset 2px 2px #fff,
				4px 4px 0 var(--border);
			padding: 2px;
		}

		#music audio {
			width: 100%;
			padding: 8px;
		}

		#buttons {
			contain: paint;
			overflow: hidden;
			padding: 4px 0;
		}

		#socials ul {
			margin: 0;
		}

		#stats :global(.section-contents) {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 12px;
		}

		#spinning-cat {
			flex: 1 1 auto;
			overflow: hidden;
		}

		#spinning-cat :global(.section-contents) {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			position: relative;
			height: 100%;
			z-index: 1;
		}

		#spinning-cat img {
			margin: 8px 0;
			position: relative;
			z-index: 1;
		}

		#spinning-cat span {
			user-select: none;
			font-size: 64px;
			font-family: var(--font-display);
			font-style: italic;
			opacity: 0.5;
			position: absolute;
		}

		.sepia {
			position: absolute;
			right: 0px;
			top: -50px;
		}

		.titlebar {
			display: flex;
			justify-content: space-between;
			padding: 3px 2px 3px 3px;
			background: linear-gradient(
				90deg,
				var(--gradient-stop-2),
				var(--gradient-stop-1)
			);
			color: #000;
			font-family: var(--font-small);
			font-size: 12px;
			letter-spacing: 3px;
		}

		.titlebar .controls {
			display: flex;
		}

		.titlebar .controls button {
			display: block;
			min-height: 14px;
			min-width: 16px;
			padding: 0;
			border: none;
			border-radius: 0;
			background-color: silver;
			box-shadow:
				inset -1px -1px #0a0a0a,
				inset 1px 1px #fff,
				inset -2px -2px grey,
				inset 2px 2px #dfdfdf;
		}

		button.minimize {
			background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg width='6' height='2' fill='none' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cpath fill='%23000' d='M0 0h6v2H0z'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
			background-position: bottom 4px left 4px;
			background-repeat: no-repeat;
		}

		button.maximize {
			background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg width='9' height='9' fill='none' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cpath fill-rule='evenodd' clip-rule='evenodd' d='M9 0H0v9h9V0zM8 2H1v6h7V2z' fill='%23000'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
			background-position: top 3px left 3px;
			background-repeat: no-repeat;
		}

		button.close {
			background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg width='8' height='7' fill='none' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cpath fill-rule='evenodd' clip-rule='evenodd' d='M0 0h2v1h1v1h2V1h1V0h2v1H7v1H6v1H5v1h1v1h1v1h1v1H6V6H5V5H3v1H2v1H0V6h1V5h1V4h1V3H2V2H1V1H0V0z' fill='%23000'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
			background-position: top 4px left 4px;
			background-repeat: no-repeat;
			margin-left: 2px;
		}

		@keyframes marquee {
			from {
				transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
			}
			to {
				transform: translate3d(-50%, 0, 0);
			}
		}

		.marquee {
			--gap: 4px;
			display: flex;
			flex-shrink: 0;
			min-width: 100%;
			gap: var(--gap);
			animation: marquee 30s linear infinite;
			width: fit-content;
		}

		@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
			.marquee {
				animation: none;
				width: auto;
				overflow: auto;
			}

			.marquee .marquee-items:nth-child(2) {
				display: none;
			}
		}

		.marquee-items {
			display: flex;
			flex-shrink: 0;
			gap: var(--gap);
			white-space: nowrap;
		}

		.marquee:hover {
			animation-play-state: paused;
		}

		.marquee a {
			display: contents;
		}

		.marquee img {
			/* As god intended :p */
			width: 88px;
			height: 31px;
			image-rendering: pixelated;
		}

		#content {
			display: flex;
			gap: 16px;
			width: 100%;
			margin-top: 16px;
		}

		@media only screen and (max-width: 728px) {
			#content {
				flex-direction: column;
			}
			aside {
				width: 100%;
			}
		}

		:global(main > header::before) {
			content: "";
			width: 1px;
			height: 1px;
			bottom: 90px;
			right: 26px;
			position: absolute;
			border-radius: 6666px;
			box-shadow: none;
			pointer-events: none;
			z-index: 1000;
			mix-blend-mode: color-dodge;
			transition: box-shadow 6s linear;
		}

		:global(:has(.lamplighter:hover) main > header::before) {
			background: white;
			box-shadow:
				0 0 16px 16px white,
				0 0 64px 32px white,
				0 0 666px 666px rgb(122, 129, 84);
		}

		.button {
			cursor: default;
			text-decoration: none;
			text-transform: uppercase;
			text-align: center;
			display: inline-block;
			border-radius: 0;
			color: var(--background);
			font: inherit;
			padding: 4px 8px;
			border: 2px outset var(--border);
			background-clip: border-box;
			background: var(--border);
			font-size: 12px;
		}

		.button:active {
			border-style: inset;
		}

		.button:focus {
			outline: 1px dotted;
			outline-offset: -6px;
		}
	</style>
</Layout>
